    {
      "order": 30,
      "beat_id": "SEG04_B030",
      "scene_id": "SEG04",
      "text": "A I is that chef. Fast, capable, ready to go. ... But without a recipe, it improvises. And when you're cooking for yourself, improvisation is fine. When you're cooking for others — for production, for users, for money — you need more than vibes.",
      "expected_duration_sec": 16.8,
