    },
    {
      "order": 32,
      "beat_id": "SEG04_B032",
      "scene_id": "SEG04",
      "text": "... But here's the word most people skip. \"With.\"... Vibe coding isn't A I coding for you. It's you coding with A I. The decisions — what to build, what's good enough, what's wrong — those are yours. The implementation — the actual code — that's the A I's job.",
      "expected_duration_sec": 18.4,
      "actual_duration_sec": 15.16,
