    {
      "order": 34,
      "beat_id": "SEG04_B034",
      "scene_id": "SEG04",
      "text": "So what can A I actually do well? Prototypes. Quick experiments. \"Show me what a dashboard could look like.\"... Ten minutes, you have something to react to. Scripts and automations — rename five hundred files, convert data formats, generate boilerplate. Learning tools — \"explain this code,\"... \"what does this function do,\"... \"show me an example.\"...",
