      "beat_id": "SEG04_B035",
      "scene_id": "SEG04",
      "text": "What can't it do? Production systems — code that handles real users, real money, real data. Security — keeping attackers out, protecting passwords, encrypting sensitive information. Payment processing — where a bug means someone gets charged twice.",
